<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts temp. staff cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts temp. staff cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities initiated coverage of several temporary staaffing companies, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Prudential started coverage of Manpower Inc, SOS Staffing Services Inc, Western Staff Services Inc as a buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Prudential started coverage of Interim Services Inc as hold, a Prudential source said.</p>
</text>
